-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/20 dark:text-violet-400 border-violet-300 dark:border-violet-500/30\">State Tax</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">May 26, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">Why Texas Has No Income Tax</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">How Texas funds its government without a personal income tax, and what it means for residents in terms of property taxes and overall tax burden.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">texas</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">no income tax</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">property tax</span></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/blog/2026-federal-tax-brackets-explained\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/20 dark:text-emerald-400 border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-500/30\">Tax Guide</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">May 26, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">2026 Tax Brackets: IRS Income Tax Brackets 2026 Explained</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Complete guide to the IRS 2026 tax brackets — income tax brackets 2026, marginal tax rate, federal income tax rates, adjusted gross income, and tax credits for married couples filing jointly.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">federal</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">tax brackets</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">2026</span></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/blog/california-tax-guide-2026\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/20 dark:text-violet-400 border-violet-300 dark:border-violet-500/30\">State Tax</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">June 19, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">California Tax Guide 2026: Income Tax, Sales Tax, and Local Rates</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Complete guide to California taxes in 2026. Income tax rates, sales tax rates, district taxes, and total tax amount.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">california tax calculator</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">tax amount in california</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">sales tax rate</span></div></a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><foo